---
/** Shown instead of gear content when `locals.supabase` is null (Supabase env vars unset). */
---

<div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-200/20 bg-amber-200/5 p-6 text-sm text-amber-100/90">
  <p class="font-serif text-lg text-amber-50">Database not configured</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-slate-300/80">
    Sidereus cannot reach its database, so your sites and gear cannot be shown or saved. Set
    <code class="text-amber-200">SUPABASE_URL</code> and <code class="text-amber-200">SUPABASE_KEY</code> and restart
    the server.
  </p>
</div>
